batch_outputs:  [["\n\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of 825 and 521?\n\n# Reasoning:\nLet's think step by step. 521 has three digits, so we can break it down into three steps.\n\n1. Multiply 825 by 1 (the ones place digit of 521):\n   \\[\n   825 \\times 1 = 825\n   \\]\n2. Multiply 825 by 20 (the tens place digit of 521):\n   \\[\n   825 \\times 20 = 16,\\!500\n   \\]\n3. Multiply 825 by 500 (the hundreds place digit of 521):\n   \\[\n   825 \\times 500 = 412,\\!500\n   \\]\n\nNow, sum all the step results:\n\\[\n825 + 16,\\!500 + 412,\\!500 = 430,\\!825\n\\]\n\n# Answer:\nThe final computed product is \\(\\boxed{430,\\!825}\\).", '421, 225.\n']]
